OL,3,GNEWSABoy showcases his 'tiny gallery'
OL,4,Aof artworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boy who spent his summer holiday
OL,7,Frecreating works of art in miniature
OL,8,Fhas put his creations on display to the
OL,9,Fpublic.
OL,11,FMax, seven, recreated works including
OL,12,Fthe Mona Lisa and Vincent van Gogh's
OL,13,FThe Starry night for his "Tiny Gallery"
OL,14,Fwhich is being showcased outside his
OL,15,Fhome in Leicestershire.
OL,17,FHe said the idea for the theme of his
OL,18,Fgallery, which also features small
OL,19,Fcroissants, French flags and paintings
OL,20,Fof the Eiffel Tower, came after a visit
OL,21,Fto Paris earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
