OL,3,GNEWSABoy showcases his 'tiny gallery'
OL,4,Aof artworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMax said that next month, his pieces
OL,7,Fwill be inspired by artist Andy Warhol.
OL,8,FAll items are up for sale, with
OL,9,Fproceeds going to The Air Ambulance
OL,10,FService.
